{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/302a398a513ffd1f9b65ae404763a5dd.avif?t=1772639260\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras_big/302a398a513ffd1f9b65ae404763a5dd.avif?t=1772639260 width=800 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exertion: The Final Stand in a Dystopian Arena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exertion is a high-octane roguelike side-scroller set in a dystopian future where AI-controlled war machines have seized the battlefield. As a cutting-edge combat robot, you\u2019ll face relentless waves of deadly drones. Survive a treacherous arena filled with turrets, mines, and enemies by pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e06c73a5b6ec1734e5785c1129ae53bb.webp?t=1772639260\" width=451 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from upgrade cards after each victory. Will you go for devastating firepower, agile maneuvers, or an unbreakable defense? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.poster.avif?t=1772639260\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.webm?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.mp4?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/a9c1663907fb9b3847631f07bf1a529d.webp?t=1772639260\" width=402 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against massive war machines! Each boss brings unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and strategies to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.poster.avif?t=1772639260\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.webm?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.mp4?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly arena packed with turrets, mines, and drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down enemies with unique weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo now and dive into the chaos! Arm yourself with powerful weapons, conquer challenging missions, and upgrade your robot with every battle. Your feedback will shape the future of Exertion. Add it to your wishlist now and claim your place in this dystopian war!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164600?t=1772639260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag