nse? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.poster.avif?t=1772639260\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.webm?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/61afdbb2bf940aadc4fcb00f8cc05f17.mp4?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/a9c1663907fb9b3847631f07bf1a529d.webp?t=1772639260\" width=402 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off against massive war machines! Each boss brings unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and strategies to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.poster.avif?t=1772639260\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.webm?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd69fcec967363ea6fb39cce878b8fea.mp4?t=1772639260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly arena packed with turrets, mines, and drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa